What each part of the project is made of, and what holds it: which files, which tests, which documents.

It is read by scripts/tests-for.py ("I changed this file: what do I run?") and checked by
workbench/maintainers_test.py: every pattern names a file there is, every test is there, and every driver and every
tool belongs to a part. Areas are in alphabetical order.

	F:	Files: a path, or a pattern of them (* within a directory, a directory ending in / for all under it)
	T:	Tests: under workbench/ (or where the path says), each one run by make check unless it says otherwise
	D:	Documents that explain it
	K:	The feature of a board, or the boot argument, that starts it

